  "abstract": "Covers Web Bot Auth, the IETF webbotauth working group's profile of RFC 9421 HTTP Message Signatures for bots and AI agents, pinned to draft-ietf-webbotauth-httpsig-protocol-00. It lists two version lines: draft-ietf-webbotauth-00 (current, build) and the legacy draft-meunier individual drafts it replaced, with an upgrade checklist. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references cover versions and upgrades, RFC 9421 essentials, the signer role with Signature-Agent and the key directory, and the verifier role with key resolution, caching, SSRF limits and outcomes.",
